config AVM_ENABLE_MMRT_NIFS
    bool "Enable MMRT (int8/int4 vector kernel) NIFs"
    default y
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    help
        The mmrt module's kernels are the ESP32-S3's PIE ones; on other chips (the ESP32-P4)
        BabyTalk's speech runs on MMRT's reference kernels, but these NIFs aren't offered.
